# PII_Review is a STAGING folder — its contents must never be committed.
#
# PLCHelper, unlike the no-git client folders (BlueSky, Augean, UW_WCUP,
# UPRR_Systemwide), IS a git repo that gets pushed to GitHub. A document
# sitting here has not yet passed pii_scan.py, so committing it would push
# un-vetted content to a remote. This file ignores everything in this folder
# except itself: the folder stays tracked (so it exists on a fresh clone),
# but nothing staged inside it can be committed by accident.
#
# See claude-workflow/CASNE_PII_INTAKE_PROCESS.md for the intake process.

*
!.gitignore
